      "text_en": "I really miss the old game/account. It's not right to delete the old game, since players topped up a lot and were waiting for rewards and events. But the worst part is that recovering the old account is way too complicated, like many people said, and the game crashes as soon as I get in. I've deleted it now, fine if I don't play anymore. I really miss my old account.",
